<InfoPage title="About OurDream AI Guide" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial guide to OurDream AI, character creation, AI companion chat, roleplay privacy, and leading alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help readers understand what to test before investing time or money in an AI companion platform. Coverage focuses on character quality, conversation continuity, visual controls, privacy, deletion, billing clarity, and meaningful differences between tools.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official OurDream AI product website. Official links are clearly marked and open the product’s own site. Product features and prices can change, so readers should verify current details before subscribing.</p><h2>Editorial approach</h2><p>Each article answers a specific decision question, uses an original comparison framework, identifies uncertainty, links to primary sources, and displays publication and update dates. We do not publish bulk pages that merely exchange product names.</p></InfoPage>
